<title>USA: IDM Environmental Corp net loss widens.</title>
<headline>IDM Environmental Corp net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH RIVER, N.J. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $1.13     loss	 $0.67</p>
<p> Net	   loss	 9,150     loss	 3,870</p>
<p> Revs			21,600		   39,400</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income for fiscal 1996 included a loss of $2.1 million for previously accrued revenue and gross margin associated with change-order claims and an approximately $1.0 million reserve associated with the write-down of a promissory note and inventory.</p>
